{
  "title": "ერთი ყავა, გთხოვთ!",
  "translation": "One coffee, please!",
  "topics": "In a café: ordering with *მინდა* (I want) and *გთხოვთ* (please), asking the price, the lari",
  "interface": "english",
  "titles": {
    "grammar": "Grammar",
    "use": "Practice",
    "vocabulary": "Words",
    "reading": "Read",
    "writing": "Write"
  },
  "keys": "აბგდევზთიკლმნოპჟრსტუფქღყშჩცძწჭხჯჰ",
  "grammar": {
    "explain": [
      "Georgian cafés and restaurants are a big part of daily life. In this lesson you learn to order, ask how much it costs and pay.",
      {
        "h": "I want…"
      },
      "*მინდა* means *I want*: *მინდა ყავა* (*I want a coffee*). *Do you want…?* to a friend is *გინდა*…? The thing you want doesn't change: *ყავა, ჩაი, წყალი*.",
      {
        "table": {
          "head": [
            "Georgian",
            "meaning"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "რა გნებავთ?",
              "what would you like? (the waiter, politely)"
            ],
            [
              "მინდა…",
              "I want…"
            ],
            [
              "ერთი ყავა, გთხოვთ.",
              "one coffee, please."
            ],
            [
              "ყავა თუ ჩაი?",
              "coffee or tea?"
            ],
            [
              "რა ღირს?",
              "how much is it?"
            ],
            [
              "ანგარიში, გთხოვთ.",
              "the bill, please."
            ],
            [
              "ინებეთ.",
              "here you are."
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "*გთხოვთ* is the polite *please*; to a friend you can say *გთხოვ*. *თუ* means *or* in a question: *ყავა თუ ჩაი?*",
      {
        "h": "Paying"
      },
      "The Georgian money is the lari (*ლარი*); one lari has 100 tetri (*თეთრი*). After a number, *ლარი* stays singular: *ხუთი ლარი* (*five lari*).",
      "More numbers: 11 *თერთმეტი*, 12 *თორმეტი*, 15 *თხუთმეტი*."
    ]
  },
  "use": {
    "exercises": [
      {
        "type": "choice",
        "prompt": "What do you say?",
        "questions": [
          {
            "q": "You want to order a tea.",
            "options": [
              "*ერთი ჩაი, გთხოვთ.",
              "ანგარიში, გთხოვთ.",
              "რა ღირს?"
            ]
          },
          {
            "q": "You want to pay.",
